acceptance_criteria: "Permission loss and actual query exclusion remain distinct; Incomplete page chains never produce deletion proposals; Typed SDK and CLI return bounded TOON/JSON, typed refusals and remedies; work without git; README and example, behavioral revert proof, public tracker validation and npm/Bun CI release gates"
resolution: "Separates permission loss from actual JQL exclusion, refuses deletion proposals from incomplete page chains and exposes documented compact no-git SDK/CLI with public-copy and npm/Bun CI evidence."
expected_result: "Permission loss and actual query exclusion remain distinct; Incomplete page chains never produce deletion proposals; Typed SDK and CLI return bounded TOON/JSON, typed refusals and remedies; work without git; README and example, behavioral revert proof, public tracker validation and npm/Bun CI release gates"
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/157, merged 2026-10-23T19:25:51Z, merge 7ceaabe20725a3d55e614cbc266742fc81d0847b: Separates permission loss from actual JQL exclusion, refuses deletion proposals from incomplete page chains and exposes documented compact no-git SDK/CLI with public-copy and npm/Bun CI evidence."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T16:44:54.176Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check (2026.10.23 CLI, pinned 2026.10.20 SDK): core listAllComplete/certifyCompleteListResult own certified tracker reads, workspace snapshots own capture/restore, and generic query cursors own pagination. No Jira query-membership explanation surface found. Existing Jira enhanced-search importer validates cursor traversal but intentionally stops at caller limits; selection comparison must independently require a terminal page. pm-graph snapshot-impact compares relationships, reachability and evidence, not Jira membership. Reuse host command contracts, TOON/JSON rendering, read_output budgeting and semantic refusal envelopes; use SDK complete reads for public tracker validation. Design: explicit v1 site/principal/scope-bound page-chain snapshots; absence remains unresolved unless independent visibility or permission-loss evidence is supplied. No local or remote mutations or deletion proposals."
  "2026-10-23T16:50:45.321Z",codex-agent,"Implemented typed snapshot validation, bounded deterministic change pages and host-registered jira explain-selection. Cursor chains require initial request, exact opaque continuations, unique keys and a final page; capped imports refuse. Added explicit query_excluded evidence rather than inferring exclusion from visibility alone, because Jira search is eventually consistent. Bare absence, visible-only, unknown and not_found observations stay unresolved. Same-site/principal/scope and chronological snapshots are mandatory. Pure comparison tests pass 8/8 with 100% lines/branches/functions for the comparison module. Installed CLI/no-git checks and public tracker projection are underway."
  "2026-10-23T16:53:09.259Z",codex-agent,"Public main tracker validation: 105 certified unique items (5 active), full bodies and terminal states, no omissions. Read-only exported copy in a non-git scratch project with git absent from PATH remained byte-identical. Status-membership projection: before 102 keys/3 pages, after 5 keys/1 page, retained 2, entries 3, exits 100; 32 default rows use 3061 JSON bytes, all 103 changes recovered in seven-row pages. Removing evidence yields 100 unresolved exits; injected permission-loss assertions yield 100 permissionLost and zero queryExcluded. A truncated chain refuses. Zero writes/deletion proposals. Permission assertions are injected; this does not certify live Jira. Installed CLI no-git JSON/TOON and local-edit/closed-item byte-preservation tests pass. Host read_output requires an empty changes array on refusal envelopes; implemented that contract."
  "2026-10-23T16:55:19.189Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: changing only explainJqlSelectionChanges to treat every absent key as query_excluded makes the permission/absence regression FAIL (6 excluded versus expected 1 excluded, 1 permission loss, 4 unresolved). Restored the function. Separately removing only validateSnapshot terminal-position validation makes the truncated-chain regression FAIL by returning explained instead of refused. Restored the validator. Neither proof removes an export or relies on compilation failure; tests import source directly. Restored targeted suite: 12/12 pass with both new modules at 100% lines/branches/functions. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring lint and diff whitespace checks pass; the repo has no separate lint script. Full npm and Bun release checks are reserved for CI per the shared-host constraint."
  "2026-10-23T16:57:04.606Z",codex-agent,"Linked pm test run completed successfully: node --test test/jql-selection.test.ts test/jql-selection-command.test.ts, 12 passed / 0 failed / 0 skipped. Project test-result tracking is disabled, so this comment preserves the measured result without changing tracker policy. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run docstring (12 files/69 declarations), git diff --check, changelog:full and changelog:check pass. No separate lint executable/script is installed. Next: push ready-for-review PR and wait for both Node matrix jobs to pass npm and Bun release:check at unchanged 100% thresholds."
  "2026-10-23T17:02:13.475Z",codex-agent,"Ready-for-review PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/157 . CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/actions/runs/39991217090 passed at implementation head d677095fbcaf493c14cacc1f38f14caffbdf7d96: Node 22 and 26 each pass npm run release:check and bun run release:check, 271/271 tests per gate (zero failures, skips or cancellations), four reported source files at 100% lines/branches/functions, zero production audit vulnerabilities. Both jobs pass strict tracker health and committed-dist equality. Local strict health separately reported extension version skew and merge-fence drift; the fresh CI installation is clean. Hound reports legacy syntax-parser complaints on valid generated modern modules; follow-up pm-jira-92cf tracks that separate configuration problem. CodeRabbit skipped automatic review and Sourcery is quota-limited; neither is approval. Final documentation clarifies recovery from further host output-budget omissions. Only documentation and PM handoff evidence change after this tested implementation; final-head CI will be linked in the PR body. No merge or release; leave open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-23T19:02:57.094Z",codex-agent,"Review round: synced the remote branch; origin/main is already an ancestor. Fetched all 23 unresolved threads and every comment (no pagination remaining). All are Hound legacy-parser diagnostics on generated ES2022 modules. CodeRabbit has no review body or outside-diff findings; only an automatic-review skip notice. Verify all parser findings with compiler and Node syntax checks, self-review the whole PR, add behavioral regressions/revert evidence for any valid defects, then run unchanged npm and Bun release gates. No thread replies/resolution, merge, release, or reviewer mentions."
  "2026-10-23T19:05:03.905Z",codex-agent,"Verified all 23 unresolved Hound findings as invalid syntax diagnoses: package type=module, compiler ES2022/NodeNext, Node >=22.18.0. npm run typecheck and node --check on dist/index.js, dist/jql-selection-command.js and dist/jql-selection.js pass. All complaints are valid ES module declarations, const/let, object shorthand, or cascading errors from optional catch bindings. Per-thread decisions and whole-diff self-review are in docs/jql-selection-review.md. No new product defect was established. Existing pm-jira-92cf retains the parser configuration follow-up; no check disabled. Targeted SDK/adapter/no-git installed CLI suite passed 12/12 with zero failures or skips."
  "2026-10-23T19:05:07.766Z",codex-agent,"Revert proofs rerun for this review: (1) change only explainJqlSelectionChanges state lookup to unconditional query_excluded, then node --test --test-name-pattern \"query exclusion and permission loss require independent evidence\" test/jql-selection.test.ts: expected 1/1 assertion failure, actual six query exclusions / zero permission-loss / zero unresolved versus expected one / one / four. (2) remove only validateSnapshot terminal-position guard, then node --test --test-name-pattern \"missing, truncated, cycling, disconnected and premature-terminal chains\" test/jql-selection.test.ts: expected 1/1 assertion failure, explained instead of refused. Each function restored immediately; no missing-export or compilation-error proof. Tests import source. No new runtime fix is needed for invalid parser findings."
  "2026-10-23T19:10:30.052Z",codex-agent,"Linked pm test verification passed both commands: 12/12 feature tests (zero failures/skips/cancellations) and all three Node generated-module syntax checks. Test-result tracking is disabled by project policy; this comment preserves evidence without changing policy. Changelog full generation and check pass. The isolated local npm release gate is progressing slowly under shared-host load; typecheck, build and docstrings (12 files, 69 declarations) passed. Push the evidence-only review commit to run the existing complete Node 22/26 npm/Bun CI matrix; record final measured gate counts before handoff. No source changes, threshold changes or review-service configuration changes."
  "2026-10-23T19:16:43.908Z",codex-agent,"Complete release evidence: CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/actions/runs/40009578886 passed at 910585184c134be75b372bfd737dcb2c981e516b. Node 22 and 26 each passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 4/4 gates, 271/271 tests per gate, zero failures/skips/cancellations, all four source files at 100% lines/branches/functions, zero production audit vulnerabilities. Both jobs also passed strict tracker health, committed-dist equality and Bun installation. Full rebuild left dist unchanged. No thresholds changed. The extra local npm release gate ran with env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1; after CI passed, the slow redundant local run was deliberately stopped under host load. It is not counted as a pass or timeout. No assertion failure was reported before it stopped. No new product defect was established; all 23 thread decisions and two verified behavioral revert failures are documented in docs/jql-selection-review.md. Final handoff changes only docs and PM evidence, and CI will rerun on that pushed head. Leave this item in_progress for orchestrator verification. Existing Hound parser configuration follow-up pm-jira-92cf remains open; CodeRabbit skipped review. No thread replies/resolution, merge or release."
